# This directory is written by the OwaspHeaders.Core NuGet package when you build, and is
# refreshed whenever the package is updated. It ignores everything in it, this file included,
# so nothing here shows up in git.
#
# To stop the package writing it, set either property in your project or Directory.Build.props:
#   <OwaspHeadersCoreAgentSkill>false</OwaspHeadersCoreAgentSkill>  (this package only)
#   <EnableEmbeddedAgentSkills>false</EnableEmbeddedAgentSkills>    (every package that honours it)
#
# See https://gaprogman.github.io/OwaspHeaders.Core/agent-skills
*
